# clustering-analysis-v3 部署清单
# 源:  scripts/clustering-analysis-v3/
# 标:  /root/.hermes/scripts/clustering-analysis-v3/
# 影响: cron 触发的聚类分析任务；无需重启服务
#
# 语法: 每行一个 glob 模式（相对项目根）；以 ! 开头为排除；# 起始为注释。

# === Include ===
src/clustering_analysis/**/*.py
scripts/**/*.py
scripts/**/*.sh
config/**/*.yaml
pyproject.toml
README.md
skills/**/SKILL.md

# === Exclude ===
!**/__pycache__/**
!**/*.pyc
!**/.pytest_cache/**
!**/*.egg-info/**
!**/tests/**
!**/test_*.py
